  "description": "Put some adventure back in your rides with the all new Shift Plus. Push your limits with its new 27.5x2.80\" tire size and 4-bar linkage suspension design that offers 130mm of rear travel. The Shift Plus is ready for any rough terrain your riding adventures will lead you to. Enjoy fast and smooth downhill rides while still being able to climb well thanks to the tubeless ready, easy-rolling WTB Trail Blazer 2.8\" TCS tires.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Dual Suspended 4-Bar Linkage frame, 27.5\" Plus / 29\" geometry, 130mm rear travel, Tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12x148mm Boost Thru-Axle dropouts\nRockShox Monarch RL Solo Air rear shock w/ rebound adjuster and Lock-out\nRockShox Reba RL 27.5in Plus fork, 1.5in Taper alloy steerer, 120mm Travel, Boost 15x110mm Thru-Axle, w/ Maxle Stealth axle\nComet Compact Single Speed 30T crankset w/ Megatooth V3 chainring, Boost 148 compatible\nShimano XT SGS 11-speed Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nShimano XT I-Spec 11-speed rear shifter\nShimano XT 11-speed, 11-42 cassette\nWTB Rocket Comp saddle\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus alloy double wall rims, w/ TCS i45 rim tape, Pivit Boost disc sealed bearing hubs, Thru-Axles 15x110mm Front & 12x148mm Rear\nShimano SLX Hydraulic I-Spec disc brakeset\nRitchey MTN Trail handlebar, 20mm rise, 710 to 740mm wide\nRitchey MTN Trail stem, 3D forged, 0 Deg., Ext.: 60 to 70mm",
